@startuml oscal-catalog-status
[*] --> converting
converting --> converted : AI conversion succeeds
converting --> conversion_failed : FR-013 collision / FR-014 LLM error/timeout
converted --> validating : trestle validate
validating --> validated : structural checks pass
validating --> validation_failed : structural checks fail (FR-003)
conversion_failed --> [*]
validation_failed --> [*]
validated --> [*]
note right of conversion_failed
  Resubmission under the same
  Source Document Identifier
  starts a fresh run (FR-015),
  not a transition from here.
end note
@enduml
